/**
 * PDFGenerator_v14_Undo_Names_Progress_Verification.gs
 * Keep the journal's existing Code.gs unchanged.
 * Uses A (student), D (program), E (current project), I (tracker URL),
 * and J for Scratch Jr when present; writes status ONLY to N.
 * No extra PDF metadata columns are created.
 * New belts automatically preserve the old and new trackers in a child-named folder.
 * Before each update, saves a backup to "Tracker PDF Undo Backups" in Drive.
 * Undo Last PDF Update is available inside the Generate Tracker PDFs popup,
 * as well as in the Tracker PDFs menu. A day batch is one undoable operation.
 * The popup closes after a fully successful single/student-day operation.
 * Unity projects get no autogenerated "Working on ...!" notes.
 * IMPACT progress follows the journal project; explicit skipped activities are preserved.
 * Notes are REPLACED in their existing fillable fields; they are never appended.
 * C / W / L progress markers are updated with fresh PDF appearance streams.
 * Later IMPACT C/W/R/L markers are cleared to match the selected journal project.
 * Undo preview lists the exact student(s) and tracker(s) that will be restored.
 * Save-time validation checks EVERY changed dropdown before replacing originals.
 */

